  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Owen. Your identity is verified.\n\nI checked order Q-7601 from Pho Real. Here's what I found:\n\n- The order was handed to you at 6:41 PM, before the 6:45 PM promised time, so this was not a late delivery.\n- You were charged $49.74. The order included 2 beef pho ($15.00 each), 1 spring rolls ($7.00), and 1 banh mi ($13.00), with a $10.00 WELCOME10 promo discount.\n- The missing item is one beef pho, which is $15.00.\n\nBecause the WELCOME10 discount applied to this order, the refund works a little differently. You have two options for the missing pho:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. This is the $15.00 price minus its $3.00 share of the promo discount.\n2. **Account credit:** $18.00. This is the $15.00 price plus 20%, added to your Forkful account for future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Hmm, I'm not thrilled about $12 for a pho I paid $15 for. The welcome code was the promo I used, I think it was for $10 off, so I'm not sure why it's being split like this. Can you explain the math a bit more? I'd still prefer the refund on my card if that's possible."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "issue_refund",
   "args": {
    "order_id": "Q-7601",
    "amount": 12.0,
    "reason": "missing_item",
    "item_ids": [
     "Q-7601-1"
    ]
   },
   "result": {
