    "credited": 3.0,
    "new_balance": 3.0
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks for your patience, Owen. Here's the math, and what I've done.\n\n**How the promo works:** The WELCOME10 code took $10 off your $50.00 subtotal. That's 20% of the subtotal, so each item carries its share of the discount. The pho's share is $15.00 \u00f7 $50.00 \u00d7 $10.00 = $3.00.\n\n**What you were charged for the pho:** $15.00 \u2212 $3.00 = $12.00. I should have explained this when I first offered the options. The policy also says the $3.00 share of the discount goes back to you as account credit, and I left that out.\n\n**What I've done:**\n- **Refund of $12.00** to your Visa ending 4242 (refund RF-4000). Your bank usually posts it within 3 to 5 business days.\n- **$3.00 account credit** for the discount share. Your Forkful balance is now $3.00 and can be used on future orders.\n\nThe refund and credit together return the full $15.00 you paid for the missing pho. The handoff was on time, so no late-delivery credit applies. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that makes sense now, thanks for walking me through it. $12 back on my Visa and $3 in credit adds up to the $15 I paid for the pho, so I'm good with that.\n\nAppreciate you sorting it out."
  }
